# Spatial Lab — Project Structure

## Stack

- Next.js App Router (`src/app/`)
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS (`src/styles/`, `src/app/globals.css`)
- shadcn/ui (`src/components/ui/`, `components.json`)
- Framer Motion (`src/components/motion/`, `src/lib/motion/`)

## Component Layers

1. **ui/** — shadcn primitives only; add via CLI, do not hand-roll equivalents
2. **motion/** — reusable animation wrappers and variants
3. **shared/** — cross-section composed primitives (typography, media, navigation)
4. **layout/** — page shells and responsive split layouts (38/62 desktop, stacked mobile)
5. **sections/** — domain sections mapped to design spec

## Design Reference

See `docs/design-spec.md` for colors, typography, motion, and layout rules.
